        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 944, Sophisticated Solid Brass Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe level of sophistication achieved by Omnia's 944 Lever and Rose set has everything to do with the attention to the traditional while still managing to look classically stylish. The round rose is designed to cover standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drill door bore holes for an easy installation. This Sophisticated Solid Brass Leverset is available in 7 different finishes in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sophisticated Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 944 Sophisticated Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sophisticated Lever",
                "description": "The level of sophistication achieved by Omnia's 944 Lever and Rose set has everything to do with the attention to the traditional while still managing to look classically stylish. The round rose is designed to cover standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drill door bore holes for an easy installation. This Sophisticated Solid Brass Leverset is available in 7 different finishes in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-944/00, Omnia traditional door levers, Elegant door lever latchsets, Omnia 944 door levers, brass circular door levers, simple door levers, Omnia solid brass door lever latchsets, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, omnia posh levers, omnia 944 Sophisticated door leversets, 944/00 omnia levers,"
